{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 323px;","style":"width: 313px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"女菀 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/女菀 13-20240820164108-aqqxx1x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 313px;\" parent-style=\"width: 323px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 328px;","style":"width: 318px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"女菀 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/女菀 14-20240820164149-nmknxtx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 318px;\" parent-style=\"width: 328px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 336px;","style":"width: 326px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"女菀 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/女菀 8-20240820163552-vy5ges7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 326px;\" parent-style=\"width: 336px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611174147-cnjetr9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174147-cnjetr9","updated":"20240820164344"}},{"ID":"20240611174404-463w5nz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174404-463w5nz","updated":"20240611174411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女菀《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174404-plosjq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174404-plosjq4","updated":"20240611174404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《御览》作菀）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174404-5sn36rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174404-5sn36rq","updated":"20240611174404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174404-k1y3nll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174404-k1y3nll","updated":"20240611174404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主风，洗洗，霍乱，泄利，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百疾。生川谷，或山阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174404-eo3h2ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174404-eo3h2ss","updated":"20240611174404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：女菀，一名白菀，一名识女苑。（《御览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174404-vuvljk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174404-vuvljk6","updated":"20240611174404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名白菀，一名织女菀，一名茆，生汉中，正月二月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174404-bnng5wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174404-bnng5wk","updated":"20240611174404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：女肠，女菀也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174448-4tbmdrc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174448-4tbmdrc"}},{"ID":"20240611174449-bhl9ijt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174449-bhl9ijt","updated":"20240611174453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女菀《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174449-7zsmf3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174449-7zsmf3b","updated":"20240611174449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主风寒洗洗，霍乱泄痢肠鸣，疗肺伤咳逆出汗，久寒在膀胱，支满惊痫，寒热百疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174438-volvkte","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174438-volvkte"}},{"ID":"20240611174439-djz3du1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174439-djz3du1","updated":"20240611174443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女菀《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174439-ksfw773","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174439-ksfw773","updated":"20240611174439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174439-wuuo6p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174439-wuuo6p3","updated":"20240611174439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】辛温，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174439-h7lxv00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174439-h7lxv00","updated":"20240611174439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主风寒洗洗，霍乱，泄痢，肠鸣，上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174439-woivn89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174439-woivn89","updated":"20240611174439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶女菀，即白菀。与紫菀同类，紫白虽异，生成则一也。畏卤咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174439-56smt6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174439-56smt6a","updated":"20240611174439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶白菀与紫菀功用，似同而异，紫主寒热气结在中，致病上中及下；白主风寒寒热，气结在枢，亦病上中及下，兼见内外开阖之象，故上下无尝，内外不定，菀从结枢，解即分散，则呕逆自开，泄痢自阖，惊痫自平，寒热自除矣。并偏于从枢解表，从枢利小水也。虽非金郁，设舍假泄金郁之法，亦难以从枢分解耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174429-6f6itju","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174429-6f6itju"}},{"ID":"20240611174430-4u2emy7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174430-4u2emy7","updated":"20240611174434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女菀《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174430-0vrt9uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174430-0vrt9uw","updated":"20240611174430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、温，无毒。主疗风寒洗洗，霍乱，泄痢，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百疾，疗肺伤咳逆出汗，久寒在膀胱支满，饮酒夜食发病。一名白菀，一名织女菀，一名茆。生汉中川谷或山阳，正月、二月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174430-buef5oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174430-buef5oh","updated":"20240611174430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏卤咸。比来医方都无复用之。市人亦少有，便是欲绝。别复有白菀似紫菀，非此之别名〔谨案〕白菀即女菀，更无别者，有名未用中，浪出一条，无紫菀时亦用之，功效相似也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174417-o5p928w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174417-o5p928w"}},{"ID":"20240611174418-uxko3vm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174418-uxko3vm","updated":"20240611174424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女菀《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174418-h6a7arc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174418-h6a7arc","updated":"20240611174418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛。温，无毒，主风寒洗洗，霍乱，泻痢，肠鸣，上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百疾。疗肺伤咳逆出汗，久寒在膀胱，支满，饮酒夜食发病。一名白菀，一名织女菀，一名茆。生汉中川谷或山阳，正月二月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174147-jcbvzit","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174147-jcbvzit"}},{"ID":"20240611174352-qzsshmm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174352-qzsshmm","updated":"20240611174400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174352-y3v4bt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174352-y3v4bt1","updated":"20240611174352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白者名女菀"}]},{"ID":"20240611174352-0c5zgup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174352-0c5zgup","updated":"20240611174352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛微温，无毒。或酒洗，或蜜水炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174352-605ozqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174352-605ozqd","updated":"20240611174352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主咳逆上气，胸中寒热结气，去蛊毒，痿 、安五脏。女菀治风寒洗洗，霍乱泄利，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百病。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174352-xmmc97n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174352-xmmc97n","updated":"20240611174352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 紫菀，肺经血分之药。《本经》止咳逆上气，胸中寒热结气，取性疏利肺经血气也。去蛊毒痿 者，以其辛苦微温，能散结降气，蛊毒自不能留。痿 由肺热叶焦，紫菀专通肺气，使热从溲便去耳。《别录》疗咳唾脓血。《大明》消痰止渴，皆滋肺经血气之效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174352-ovczeni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174352-ovczeni","updated":"20240611174352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》泽漆汤用以治咳而脉沉者，咳属肺；脉沉则血分之病也。亦治下痢肺痛，与紫参同功。其性辛而不燥，润而不寒，补而不滞，善调五劳体虚，止咳定喘，疗惊悸，吐衄诸血。又能通调水道，故溺涩便血单服一两即效。然大泄肺气，阴虚肺热干咳禁用，以其性专温散而无培养之力也。白者曰女菀，大泄肺气。《本经》主风寒洗洗，霍乱泄利，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫寒热百病，一皆气分受伤之病。《肘后方》治人面黑令白，方用女菀三分，铅丹一分为末，醋浆服一刀圭，日进三服，十日大便黑，二十一日面白，便止。过用则太白矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174352-occwfc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174352-occwfc6","updated":"20240611174352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《千金方》用酒服，男十日，女二十日，黑色皆从大便去。三十岁后不可服，以肺气渐减，不可复泄也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174527-x2dbagy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174527-x2dbagy"}},{"ID":"20240611174528-06b85qz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174528-06b85qz","updated":"20240611174535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174528-5oz6het","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174528-5oz6het","updated":"20240611174528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦温，无毒。主治咳逆上气，胸中寒热结气，去蛊毒，痿 ，安五脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174528-jaeabu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174528-jaeabu3","updated":"20240611174528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（紫菀之根紫色，而其质柔宛，故名紫菀。近道处处有之，三四月布地生苗，本有白毛，其叶二四相连，五六月开黄白紫花，结黑子。其根细而白者，白菀，即女菀也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174528-yfe10jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174528-yfe10jy","updated":"20240611174528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫，黑赤之间色也。黑赤，水火之色也。紫菀气味苦温，禀火气也。其质阴柔，禀水气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174528-nsswdrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174528-nsswdrv","updated":"20240611174528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治咳逆上气者，启太阳寒水之气，从皮毛而合肺也。治胸中寒热结气者，助少阴火热之气，通利三焦而上达也。蛊毒在腹属土，火能生土，故去蛊毒。痿 在筋，属木，水能生木，故去痿 。水火者，阴阳之征兆也。水火交，则阴阳合，故安五脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174609-hq2s148","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174609-hq2s148"}},{"ID":"20240611174610-df5gsl6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174610-df5gsl6","updated":"20240611174616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174610-k3zhs72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174610-k3zhs72","updated":"20240611174610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、辛，温，无毒。主咳逆上气，胸中寒热结气，去蛊毒，痿蹶，安五脏，疗咳唾脓血，止喘悸，五劳体虚，补不足，小儿惊痫。一名紫茜，一名青苑。生房陵山谷及真定、邯郸。二月、三月采根，阴干。款冬为之使，恶天雄、瞿麦、雷丸、远志，畏茵陈蒿。陶隐居云∶近道处处有，生布地，花亦紫，本有白毛，根甚柔细。有白者名白菀，不复用。唐本注云∶白菀即女菀也。疗体与紫菀同。无紫菀时亦用白菀。陶云不复用，或者未悉。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶紫菀，臣，味苦，平。能治尸疰，补虚，下气及胸胁逆气，治百邪鬼魅，劳气虚热。日华子云∶调中及肺痿吐血，消痰止渴，润肌肤，添骨髓。形似重台，根作节，紫色，润软者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174610-9r7p3jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174610-9r7p3jx","updated":"20240611174610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶紫菀，生房陵山谷及真定、邯郸，今耀、成、泗、寿、台、孟州，兴国军皆有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174610-rfvwz52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174610-rfvwz52","updated":"20240611174610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三月内布地生苗叶，其叶三、四相连，五月、六月内开黄、紫、白花，结黑子。本有白毛，根甚柔细。二月、三月内取根阴干用。又有一种白者名白菀。苏恭云∶白菀即女菀也。疗体并同，无紫菀时，亦可通用。女菀下自有条，今人亦稀用。《古今传信方》∶用之最要，近医疗久嗽不瘥，此方甚佳。紫菀去芦头、款冬花各一两，百部半两，三物捣罗为散，每服三钱匕。生姜三片，乌梅一个，同煎汤调下，食后、欲卧各一服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174610-hf2mj22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174610-hf2mj22","updated":"20240611174610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本余∶治气喘，阴痿。雷公云∶凡使，先去髭，有白如练色者，号曰羊须草，自然不同。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174610-ff1chjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174610-ff1chjr","updated":"20240611174610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采得后，去头土了，用东流水淘洗令净，用蜜浸一宿。至明于火上焙干用。凡修一两，用蜜二分。千金方∶治妇人卒不得小便。紫菀末，以井花水服三撮，便通。小便血，服五撮立止。斗门方治缠喉风，喉闭饮食不通欲死者。用返魂草根一茎，净洗纳入喉中，待取恶涎出即瘥，神效。更以马牙硝津咽之，即绝根本。一名紫菀，又南中呼为液牵牛是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174610-m7cjexq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174610-m7cjexq","updated":"20240611174610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶紫菀，用根。其根柔细，紫色，益肺气，《经》具言之。《唐本》注言无紫菀时，亦用白菀。白菀即女菀也。今本草无白菀之名，盖唐修本草时已删去。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174622-466jzxn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174622-466jzxn"}},{"ID":"20240611174625-zo3tg1e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174625-zo3tg1e","updated":"20240611174630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174625-ujrerpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174625-ujrerpk","updated":"20240611174625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（隰草）泻肺血热"}]},{"ID":"20240611174625-0wwwmnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174625-0wwwmnf","updated":"20240611174625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀（专入肺）。辛苦而温。色赤。虽入至高之脏。仍兼下降。故书载入肺金血分。（辛入肺。赤入血。）能治虚痨咳嗽惊悸吐衄诸血。又能通调水道。（苦可下降。）以治溺涩便血。用此上下皆宜。且此辛而不燥。润而不滞。（李士材比为金玉君子。非多用独用不能速效。）于肺实为有益。然疏泄性多。培养力少。与桑白皮杏仁同为一类。但桑白皮杏仁则泻肺经气分。此则专泻血经气分也。故肺虚干咳禁用。（干咳类多血虚。不宜再泻。）紫色润软者良。（人多以车前旋复花乱之。）其药虽分上中与下。然下疏泄尤甚。蜜炒用款冬为使。白者名女菀。入气分。大泄肺气。肘后方用此三分。铅丹一分。并酸浆服一刀圭。日进三服。至二十一日。能令面黑转白。过服不宜。去头须。蜜水炒用。款冬为使。恶天雄瞿麦 本远志。畏茵陈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174646-yi8uqd4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174646-yi8uqd4"}},{"ID":"20240611174648-ry92757","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174648-ry92757","updated":"20240611174652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174648-qknssxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174648-qknssxu","updated":"20240611174648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦辛．入手太阴经．功专疗咳逆上气．得款冬、百部、乌梅治久咳．得白前、半夏、大戟治水气喘逆．蜜水浸焙用．款冬为使．恶天雄、瞿麦、 本、远志．畏茵陈．白者名女菀．"}]},{"ID":"20240611174659-0owyan6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174659-0owyan6"}},{"ID":"20240611174700-x8vhc6h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174700-x8vhc6h","updated":"20240611174708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174700-yuyu8p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174700-yuyu8p2","updated":"20240611174705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"紫菀"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生房陵山谷，及真定邯郸，今耀、成、泗、寿、台、孟州、兴国军皆有之。三月内布地生苗叶，其叶三、四相连；五月、六月内开黄紫白花；结黑子。本有白毛，根甚柔细。二月、三月内取根，阴干用。又有一种白者，名白菀。苏恭云∶白菀即女菀也，疗体并同。无紫菀时，亦可通用女菀。下自有条。今人亦稀用。古今《传信方》用之最要，近医疗久嗽不瘥，此方甚佳。紫菀去芦头，款冬花各一两，百部半两，三物捣罗为散，每服三钱匕。生姜三片，乌梅一个，同煎汤调下，食后欲卧，各一服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174556-a1wmu7v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174556-a1wmu7v"}},{"ID":"20240611174558-wtnlhmp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174558-wtnlhmp","updated":"20240611174602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫菀《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174558-4nccydc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174558-4nccydc","updated":"20240611174558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"润肺下气．"}]},{"ID":"20240611174558-7v9gzur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174558-7v9gzur","updated":"20240611174558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温润肺，苦温下气，化痰止渴．治寒热结气．咳逆上气．咳吐脓血．（专治血痰、为血劳圣药．）肺经虚热．小儿惊痫．（亦虚而有热．）能开喉痹．取恶涎．又能通利小肠．（本草汇云∶苦能达下、辛可益金、故吐血保肺、收为上剂、虽入至高、善于达下、使气化及于州都、小便自利．）辛散性滑．暂用之品．阴虚肺热者、不宜专用多用．须地黄麦冬共之．根作节、紫色润软者良．（今人多以车前、旋复根伪之．）白者名女菀．（时珍曰∶紫入血分、白入气分．）去头须．蜜水浸焙．款冬为使．恶天雄、瞿麦、 本、远志．畏茵陈．（妇人小便卒不得出、或小便血、紫菀为末服．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174147-36olil8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174147-36olil8"}},{"ID":"20240611174250-ycqese0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174250-ycqese0","updated":"20240611174255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女菀《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174250-ld1jkjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174250-ld1jkjm","updated":"20240611174250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．主治肺伤、咳逆，出汗，久寒在膀胱支满，饮酒夜食发病．一名白菀，一名织菀，一名苑．生汉中或山阳．正月、二月采，阴干．（畏卤咸．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174250-iea9r5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174250-iea9r5h","updated":"20240611174250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶女菀，味辛，温．主风寒洗洗，霍乱泄利，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫寒热百疾．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240611174147-156iz7k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174147-156iz7k"}},{"ID":"20240611174240-dmi3639","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174240-dmi3639","updated":"20240611174246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女菀《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174240-150tuzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174240-150tuzr","updated":"20240611174240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主风寒洗洗，霍乱泄痢，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百疾。疗肺伤咳逆出汗，久寒在膀胱支满，饮酒夜食发病。一名白菀，一名织女菀，一名茆（音柳）。生汉中川谷或山阳。正月、二月采，阴干。（畏卤碱。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174240-i4hn5bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174240-i4hn5bc","updated":"20240611174240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶比来医方都无复用之。市人亦少有，便是欲绝。别复有白菀似紫菀，非此之别名也。唐本注云∶白菀即女菀，更无别者，有名未用中浪出一条。无紫菀时亦用之，功效相似也。臣禹锡等今据有名未用中，无白菀者，盖唐修本草时删去尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174240-rihhind","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174240-rihhind","updated":"20240611174240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶女菀，一名白菀。或者谓为二物，非也。唐删去白菀之条，甚合宜。陶能言，不能指说性状。余从《经》中所说甚明，今直取《经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174147-xhyz2ag","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174147-xhyz2ag"}},{"ID":"20240611174148-a6ftyxb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-a6ftyxb","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：女菀"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-cu55gg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-cu55gg6","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-s4fp193","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-s4fp193","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Nǚ Wǎn"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-uoy03m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-uoy03m5","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-yyzly2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-yyzly2p","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 白菀、织女菀（《吴普本草》），女宛（《本草经集注》）。女肠（《广雅》），羊须草（《雷公炮炙论》），茆（《别录》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-bev7grb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-bev7grb","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-bru6rur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-bru6rur","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-qfto6sy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-qfto6sy","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-w9l18sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-w9l18sa","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女菀"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏季采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-hgh6pkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-hgh6pkk","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-4c4ab9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-4c4ab9u","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长于湿润处。分布东北及山东、江苏、浙江、安徽、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-vwfpek9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-vwfpek9","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-8c83r3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-8c83r3m","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高30～100厘米。茎直立，下半部光滑，上半都有细柔毛。叶互生，基部叶线状披针形或披针形，长5～12厘米，宽5～12毫米，先端渐锐，基部窄狭，有短柄，边缘粗糙，疏生细锯齿，花后雕落；茎上叶无柄，线状披针形至线形，上面光滑，绿色，下面有细软毛，边缘粗糙。头状花序密集成伞房状，小形，直径5～8毫米；总苞筒状，长约4毫米，苞片披针形，有细毛，数列；周围舌状花白色，舌长约2.5毫米，筒长约2毫米；中心管状花黄色，长约3.5毫米，花药基部钝而全缘；柱头2裂，裂片长圆形，先端钝。瘦果长圆形，长约1毫米，稍扁，全体有毛；冠毛灰白色或带红色。花期秋季。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-bs0g7jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-bs0g7jh","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-0vzusgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-0vzusgs","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含槲皮素。根含挥发油。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-5dfmxmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-5dfmxmz","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-tjkpkt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-tjkpkt9","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"味辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-qe8gac8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-qe8gac8","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-nexbnfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-nexbnfi","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-q0gl67u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-q0gl67u","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：\"畏卤咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-lt8981e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-lt8981e","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-atvpbb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-atvpbb3","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 温肺化痰，和中，利尿。治咳嗽气喘，肠鸣腹泻，痢疾，小便短涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-ver9v9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-ver9v9u","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主风寒洗洗，霍乱泄痢，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百疾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-usol7zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-usol7zn","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗肺伤咳逆，出汗，久寒在膀胱，支满，饮酒夜食发病。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-scahzxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-scahzxb","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《湖南药物志》：\"温肺下气，止咳化痰，利尿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-q1uc483","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-q1uc483","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-of565fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-of565fd","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-7hifrm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-7hifrm8","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-oyq4mq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-oyq4mq4","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治咳嗽气喘：女菀五钱，金线吊白米三钱，路边荆五钱。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-t6blwrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-t6blwrz","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治肠鸣腹泻：女菀五钱，陈皮二钱，菖蒲二钱。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-53tmbgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-53tmbgo","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小便短涩：女菀五钱，车前草五钱。水煎服。（选方出《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-iibxltd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-iibxltd","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-2g1pgid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-2g1pgid","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-gf7j7yf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-gf7j7yf","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：女菀"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-ulvazyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-ulvazyg","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-mrxsfda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-mrxsfda","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Nǚ Wǎn"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-4rmba0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-4rmba0j","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-94hw4re","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-94hw4re","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 白菀、织女菀、女宛、女肠、羊须草、茆"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-90adw8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-90adw8m","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-6btha43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-6btha43","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Herb of Common Turczaninowia"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-pjoi400","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-pjoi400","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-8zsi4lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-8zsi4lh","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》《纲目》：白菀即紫菀之色白者也。雷斅言紫菀白如练色者，名羊须草，恐即此物也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-se9ptl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-se9ptl5","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-igcb5mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-igcb5mx","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为菊科植物女菀的根或全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-jjer7ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-jjer7ir","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Turczaninowia fastigiata (Fisch.)DC. [Aster fastigiatrs Fisch.]"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-l92mqgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-l92mqgj","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、夏季采收全草。秋季采根，切段晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-hs3vtsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-hs3vtsa","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-w19av8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-w19av8x","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于荒地、山坡湿润处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-2lol0we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-2lol0we","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、内蒙古、河北、山西、陕西、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、河南、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-j8b3jlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-j8b3jlo","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-owpeqoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-owpeqoy","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 女菀 多年生草本，高30-100cm。茎直立，下半部光滑，上半部有细柔毛。叶互生；基部叶线状披针形，长5-12cm，宽5-12mm，基部渐狭成短移山倒柄，先端渐尖，边缘粗糙，疏生细锯齿，花后凋落；茎上部叶无柄，线状披针形至线形，上面光滑，绿色，下面有细软毛，边缘粗糙，稍反卷。头状花序多数，密集成复伞房状；总苞片3-4层，草质，边缘膜质，先端钝；外围有1层雌花，雌花舌状，舌片白以，椭圆形；中央多数两性花，花冠筒状，黄色，长约3.5mm，花药基部钝而全缘；柱头2裂，裂片长圆形，先端钝。瘦果，长圆形，长约1mm，稍扁，全体有毛，边缘有细肋；冠毛1层，灰白色或稍红色，有多数糙毛。花期秋季。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-1xzx8mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-1xzx8mx","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-pzt6vbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-pzt6vbb","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含槲皮素（quercetin），根含挥发油。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-a61pc58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-a61pc58","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-i45qqr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-i45qqr7","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-5n2q1a9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-5n2q1a9","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-lbdds5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-lbdds5t","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 畏卤碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-964l8yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-964l8yy","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-9qpa7nz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-9qpa7nz","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 温肺化痰；健脾利湿。主咳嗽气喘；泻痢；小便短涩"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-pprd8qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-pprd8qx","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-yso84ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-yso84ea","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，9-15g。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-lz7x20w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-lz7x20w","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-a7pu5xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-a7pu5xd","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主霍乱泄痢，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫，寒热百疾。2.《别录》：疗肺伤咳逆，出汗，久寒在膀胱，支满，饮酒夜食发病。3.《湖南药物志》：温肺下气，止咳化痰，利尿。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-uviv329","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-uviv329","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611174148-be855l7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174148-be855l7","updated":"20240611174148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174150-vhwfki1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174150-vhwfki1"}},{"ID":"20240611174151-bnham5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174151-bnham5d"}}]}